# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Without this, deep links that the stores actually open — /privacy, /terms,
# /support — can 404 because no matching static asset exists. The store-submitted
# privacy policy URL MUST resolve, so this is a submission-blocking detail.
#
# 200 (rewrite, not redirect) keeps the requested path in the address bar so
# react-router renders the right page.
/*  /index.html  200
